    <h6>This note</h6>
    <p>Learn № 16 · Reading numbers · version 1.0. Evergreen, written to survive the next print and, for that matter, the next base. Companion notes: <a href="/learn/index-numbers/">Index numbers and the base of 100</a>, <a href="/learn/index-weights/">Index weights</a>.</p>
    <p>Companion dossier: <a href="/dossiers/cpi/">Dossier 01 · Consumer Price Index</a>.</p>
  </div>

